      "verify_result": {
        "command": "make svg-loop",
        "exit_code": 0,
        "evidence": [
          {
            "criterion": "Pinned Chrome and frozen SVG comparisons pass",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/Library/Application Support/bboxy450-term/run/implementation-workspaces/checkouts/01M82JAA2SY4ZYPE46E90NRZ7W/target/svg-chrome-evidence/svg-loop-final.log"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Wrong browser version and opt-in saved-session replay have executable regression coverage",
            "reference": "crates/bboxy450-svg/test_corpus.py:30 and scripts/test-landing.py:1642"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Detached full parity run exited 2 on the document corpus",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/Library/Application Support/bboxy450-term/run/implementation-workspaces/checkouts/01M82JAA2SY4ZYPE46E90NRZ7W/target/ci-local.log:1356"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Formal verification exited 0 on the reported commit",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/Library/Application Support/bboxy450-term/run/implementation-workspaces/checkouts/01M82JAA2SY4ZYPE46E90NRZ7W/target/svg-chrome-evidence/formal.log"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
    ```
    """

